        {
            "id": "20261029A05QMF00",
            "title": "三星电子 MX 与 NW 业务 2026Q3 再度亏损，存储器营收环比增长 16.5%",
            "image": "https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/O4_168Dy_iTB7ijo2NlcweD27jzrgDeTqUuzgEoHYZ7xoAA_870492/0",
            "link": "https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20261029A05QMF00",
            "author": "名扬四海",
            "pub_date": "2026-10-29 11:35:12",
            "description": "<div class=\"rich_media_content\"><p data-vmark=\"8a86\">IT之家 10 月 29 日消息，根据<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">三星电子</span></span></span>分享的 2026Q3 细分业绩，其 <span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">MX 与 NW 业务</span></span></span>上季度合并营收为 37.7 万亿韩元<span class=\"exch-money-value\">（现汇率约合 1,895.93 亿元人民币）</span>，<strong>出现 0.6 万亿韩元</strong><span class=\"exch-money-value\">（现汇率约合 30.17 亿元人民币）</span><strong>亏损</strong>。</p><p data-vmark=\"7f29\"><strong>这是 MX 与 MX 业务连续第二个季度出现亏损</strong>。MX 业务的单独营收则是 37.3 万亿韩元<span class=\"exch-money-value\">（现汇率约合 1,875.82 亿元人民币）</span>。三星 MX 计划通过提高效率、灵活应对市场变化尽量减少利润下滑。</p><p data-vmark=\"bf8c\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/O153dsMtnmy4N6VsrK2uWDAe7r1OM-NzMgNVHhg9ekHwIAA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/O153dsMtnmy4N6VsrK2uWDAe7r1OM-NzMgNVHhg9ekHwIAA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;width:100%;height:100%\"/></p><p data-vmark=\"9cd2\">与此同时，三星 <span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">DS 部门</span></span></span>的整体营收达到 147.1 万亿韩元<span class=\"exch-money-value\">（IT之家注：现汇率约合 7,397.66 亿元人民币）</span>，环比增长 15%，营业利润为 106.5 万亿韩元<span class=\"exch-money-value\">（现汇率约合 5,355.88 亿元人民币）</span>。其中<strong>存储器业务贡献 140.7 万亿韩元</strong><span class=\"exch-money-value\">（现汇率约合 7,075.8 亿元人民币）</span><strong>营收</strong>，季对季增幅达 16.5%。</p><p data-vmark=\"03be\">此外，三星显示在三季度实现 8 万亿韩元<span class=\"exch-money-value\">（现汇率约合 402.32 亿元人民币）</span>营业收入，较上季度增长 6.7%，环比略有下滑；营业利润 1.1 万亿韩元<span class=\"exch-money-value\">（现汇率约合 55.32 亿元人民币）</span>。</p></div>",
            "source": "qq",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-CN"
        },
