            "title": "电子元件+回购+信心！这家公司豪掷2.5亿至5亿启动回购，首笔动作释放什么信号？",
            "image": "https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OnZghqlx9sy6LlLK-jgegAgAJ6YWpCZqW4bo98tNl_W74AA_870492/0",
            "link": "https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20261016A0DP5Z00",
